      "content": "hey i feel like i have a uti coming on again... burning when i pee and i really gotta go all the time. i have some macrobid left over from a few months ago so i was thinking i'd just take some of that to nip it in the bud. is 100mg twice a day enough or should i do more? also i have stage 3 kidney disease so i wanted to check if that's okay",
